Author: Kiran Rao <kiran@acme-health.example>
Date:   Tue Nov 3 19:00:48 2026 +0530

    Request age on the pending list (docs-in/request.md)
    
    GET /requests/pending adds ageBusinessDays, overLimit and ageLabel to each
    row: business days after receivedAt through the as-of date, skipping
    weekends and the tenant's holidays (data/holidays-<tenant>-<year>.json,
    TX-01 2026 added), over-limit when above priorauth.aging.threshold-days (5).
    Optional ?asOf=yyyy-MM-dd pins the date; an invalid asOf or one before a
    pending row's receivedAt returns 400 with a message. No pom.xml change.
    
    Requirements: FR1-FR9, NFR1-NFR6.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
